{"id": "3295632", "name": "קיצון מוחלט בתחום עם קשת וקטע ישר", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 2, "functions": [{"name": "xmap", "params": ["S", "T"], "body": "if orient=1 then cx+S\n elseif orient=2 then cx+S\n elseif orient=3 then cx+T\n else cx-T"}, {"name": "ymap", "params": ["S", "T"], "body": "if orient=1 then cy+T\n elseif orient=2 then cy-T\n elseif orient=3 then cy+S\n else cy+S"}, {"name": "leadterm", "params": ["c", "m"], "body": "if c=1 then m\n elseif c=-1 then sconcat(\"-\",m)\n else sconcat(string(c),m)"}, {"name": "addterm", "params": ["c", "m"], "body": "if c=0 then \"\"\n elseif c=1 then sconcat(\"+\",m)\n elseif c=-1 then sconcat(\"-\",m)\n elseif c>0 then sconcat(\"+\",string(c),m)\n else sconcat(string(c),m)"}, {"name": "addconst", "params": ["c"], "body": "if c=0 then \"\"\n elseif c>0 then sconcat(\"+\",string(c))\n else string(c)"}], "questiontext": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 920px; margin: auto; line-height: 1.65; text-align: right; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 14px; padding: 18px; margin-bottom: 14px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f; font-size: 20px;\">קיצון מוחלט בתחום עם קשת וקטע ישר</strong>\n<p>נתונה הפונקציה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; font-size: 19px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f(x,y)={{CT:0}}\\)</div>\n<p>בתחום הסגור המוגדר על ידי</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: white; border-radius: 9px; padding: 11px; font-size: 18px;\">\\(\\displaystyle {{CT:1}}\\leq {{CT:2}}\\) <br>[[if test=\"{{CT:5}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle y\\ge {{CT:3}}\\) [[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:6}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle y\\le {{CT:3}}\\) [[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:7}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle x\\ge {{CT:4}}\\) [[/if]] [[if test=\"{{CT:8}}\"]] \\(\\displaystyle x\\le {{CT:4}}\\) [[/if]]</div>\n<p>שפת התחום מורכבת מקטע ישר ומקשת מעגלית. מצאו את נקודות הקיצון המוחלט ואת ערכי הפונקציה בהן.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(280px,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">א. מספר הנקודות החשודות</strong>\n<p>כמה נקודות חשודות <strong>שונות</strong> יש לבדוק על שפת התחום? את שתי נקודות החיבור בין הקטע לקשת סופרים פעם אחת בלבד.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">[[input:candidatecount]]\n<div>[[validation:candidatecount]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ב. הנקודה הפנימית של הקשת</strong>\n<p>על הקשת המעגלית, מעבר לשתי נקודות הקצה, מתקבלת נקודה חשודה אחת. מצאו אותה.</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle x=\\) [[input:ans1]]    \\(\\displaystyle y=\\) [[input:ans2]] <br>[[validation:ans1]] [[validation:ans2]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr)); gap: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ג. נקודת המינימום המוחלט</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 11px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 9px;\">\\(x_{\\min}=\\) [[input:ans3]]    \\(y_{\\min}=\\) [[input:ans4]] <br>[[validation:ans3]] [[validation:ans4]]</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ד. נקודת המקסימום המוחלט</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 11px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 9px;\">\\(x_{\\max}=\\) [[input:ans5]]    \\(y_{\\max}=\\) [[input:ans6]] <br>[[validation:ans5]] [[validation:ans6]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; background: white;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">ה. ערכי הקיצון</strong>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 12px; border-radius: 9px; margin-top: 9px;\">\\(\\min f=\\) [[input:ans7]]     \\(\\max f=\\) [[input:ans8]] <br>[[validation:ans7]] [[validation:ans8]]</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"max-width: 920px; margin: auto; text-align: right; line-height: 1.7; color: #1f2937;\">\n<div style=\"background: #F4F1F5; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">1. פנים התחום</strong>\n<p>בפנים התחום מתקיים \\(t&gt;0\\). מן הנגזרות מתקבל שאין נקודה קריטית פנימית, ולכן יש לבדוק את שני חלקי השפה.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">2. הקטע הישר</strong>\n<p>על הקטע הישר מתקיים \\(t=0\\), ולכן</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 9px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f={{CT:9}}\\) <br><br>\\(\\displaystyle f'={{CT:10}}\\)</div>\n[[if test=\"{{CT:20}}\"]]\n<p>מתקבלות שתי נקודות קריטיות פנימיות של הקטע, עם \\(s=\\pm{{CT:11}}\\), בנוסף לשתי נקודות הקצה.</p>\n[[else]]\n<p>אין נקודות קריטיות פנימיות של הקטע, ולכן בקטע יש לבדוק רק את שתי נקודות הקצה.</p>\n[[/if]]</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px; margin-bottom: 12px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">3. הקשת המעגלית</strong>\n<p>על הקשת מתקיים \\(s^2+t^2=R^2\\), ולכן הפונקציה מצטמצמת ל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #FAF9FB; padding: 9px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle f={{CT:12}}\\) <br><br>\\(\\displaystyle f'={{CT:13}}\\)</div>\n<p>מעבר לשתי נקודות הקצה, מתקבלת הנקודה החשודה</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #F4F1F5; padding: 9px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle P_{\\mathrm{arc}}={{CT:14}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: white; border: 1px solid #D9D1DD; border-radius: 12px; padding: 15px;\"><strong style=\"color: #4b1f6f;\">4. השוואה</strong>\n<p>בסך הכול יש לבדוק <strong>{{CT:15}}</strong> נקודות חשודות שונות. לאחר השוואת הערכים מתקבל</p>\n<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align: center; background: #F4F1F5; padding: 10px; border-radius: 9px;\">\\(\\displaystyle P_{\\min}={{CT:16}},\\qquad P_{\\max}={{CT:17}}\\) <br><br>\\(\\displaystyle \\min f={{CT:18}},\\qquad \\max f={{CT:19}}\\)</div>\n</div>\n</div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:pcount]] [[feedback:parc]] [[feedback:ppoints]] [[feedback:pvalues]] [[feedback:porder]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "", "prtpartiallycorrect": "", "prtincorrect": "", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans2", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans3", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans4", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans5", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans6", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans7", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "ans8", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}, {"name": "candidatecount", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 5, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "parc", "value": 0.2, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "c1:if is(equal(radcan(ans1-tans1),0)) then 1 else 0;c2:if is(equal(radcan(ans2-tans2),0)) then 1 else 0;cs:(c1+c2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "cs", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "parc-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קואורדינטות נכונות בנקודת הקשת: <strong>{@c1+c2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "parc-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "pcount", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "candidatecount", "tans": "countnum", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pcount-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">מספר הנקודות החשודות נכון.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pcount-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">בדקו שוב את שני חלקי השפה ואת נקודות החיבור ביניהם.</div>"}}]}, {"name": "porder", "value": 0.1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "bad:if is(ans7>ans8)=true then 1 else 0;ord:1-bad;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ord", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-T", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "porder-1-F", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background: #FFF4E5; border: 1px solid #F3C778; border-radius: 9px; padding: 10px; font-weight: bold; color: #8a4b08;\">ערך המינימום שהזנתם גדול מערך המקסימום! זה לא הגיוני!</div>"}}]}, {"name": "ppoints", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "p1:if is(equal(radcan(ans3-tans3),0)) then 1 else 0;p2:if is(equal(radcan(ans4-tans4),0)) then 1 else 0;p3:if is(equal(radcan(ans5-tans5),0)) then 1 else 0;p4:if is(equal(radcan(ans6-tans6),0)) then 1 else 0;ps:(p1+p2+p3+p4)/4;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "ps", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ppoints-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">קואורדינטות נכונות בנקודות הקיצון: <strong>{@p1+p2+p3+p4@}</strong> מתוך 4.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "ppoints-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}, {"name": "pvalues", "value": 0.3, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "v1:if is(equal(radcan(ans7-tans7),0)) then 1 else 0;v2:if is(equal(radcan(ans8-tans8),0)) then 1 else 0;vs:(v1+v2)/2;", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "1", "tans": "1", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": "vs", "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pvalues-1-T", "feedback": "<div dir=\"rtl\">ערכי קיצון נכונים: <strong>{@v1+v2@}</strong> מתוך 2.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "penalty": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "pvalues-1-F", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["Dminus", "Dplus", "Eminus", "Eplus", "M", "Parc", "Pmax", "Pmin", "R", "a", "arcder", "arcfun", "b", "c00", "c01", "c02", "c03", "c10", "c11", "c12", "c20", "c21", "c30", "circle", "circleDisplay", "countnum", "cx", "cy", "d", "deltaD", "deltaE", "edgeder", "edgefun", "func", "funcDisplay", "hasD", "maxVal", "minVal", "orient", "pairid", "q", "s", "s0", "smax", "smin", "t", "tans1", "tans2", "tans3", "tans4", "tans5", "tans6", "tans7", "tans8", "useD", "xDisplay", "yDisplay"], "nvariants": 50}